  m_Name: Broker Standish
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.LieEncounterData
  vendorName: Broker Standish
  offerText: Hand over that towering collection of vintage books. I will give you
    an immediate cash payout and clear your shelves completely.
  acceptResultText: Standish packs the books into his van, tosses you mere pocket
    change, and drives off laughing. You have plenty of room, but you feel completely
    robbed.
  rejectResultText: You refuse his low offer. You spend the hour staring at the dusty,
    heavy books taking up your valuable shelf space.
  acceptedDelayedText: The police catch Standish running an illegal fencing ring.
    They return the market value of your books along with a hefty compensation reward!
  rejectedDelayedText: The overloaded bookshelf finally collapses under the weight,
    sending a barrage of heavy hardcovers crashing down onto your head.
  accepted: 0
